    "title": "Tonica Grade School Recognized For Efforts In Assisting Students With Military Parents - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago Efforts by Tonica Grade School to create a welcoming environment for military-connected students hasn't gone unnoticed. The school has been awarded a Purple Star School designation in recognition of its commitment to serving military-connected students and families. Tonica Grade School has implemented practices to ease student transitions, provide dedicated resources for military families, and ensure staff understand the unique experiences of students with parents or guardians in the military. Read full article\n1",
